{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026axdpE7ezX01793546261.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大角咀廟會晚上上演LED夜光龍表演。</p><p></p><p>長約500呎LED夜光龍，在鑼鼓聲伴隨下，穿梭大角咀福全街。現場有藍色燈光照射，夜光龍猶如海中暢游。龍頭不時噴出煙霧，跟市民和旅客互動，沿途有不少人舉起手機「打卡」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TEMPLE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SAlfHC7q9i1793546329.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>參與巡遊的還有國家級非物質文化遺產，沙頭角魚燈舞。大角咀廟會自2005年起首次舉辦，連同早上其他表演活動，全日吸引約18萬人次參與。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TEMPLE-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WGyZqikm2X1793546346.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>朱太說：「今年活動搞得很有氣氛，又有螢光棒助興，今年摸到會覺得樣樣很稱心如意。」</p><p></p><p>居港上海人吳小姐稱：「我媽媽第一次過來玩，我第二次來看，原來有很多驚喜很開心，龍舞起來的時間很飄逸，很長很長的龍，目不暇接。」</p><p></p><p>加拿大旅客Fabrice表示：「非常棒、非常漂亮，我們很喜歡，火龍非常出色，我們愛香港、我們愛亞洲。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:15.345906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T15:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:18.270864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:47.975267+00:00","content_hash":"d62d476af08ab20e187d2ce1b6098a63b3b1fc1f566b16ffdd8d39e290902d0a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:15.345906+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}